    <string name="help_topic_8_title">8. Shop expenses (Rent, Electricity, Salary) kaise record karein?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_8_desc">Dashboard -&gt; Operational Expenses par jayein ya Expenses card par tap karein. Amount enter karne aur category (Rent, Electricity, Salary, Repair, Refreshment, Other) chunne ke liye Add Expense button par tap karein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_9_title">9. Dashboard mein Net Profit kaise calculate hota hai?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_9_desc">Home top bar par Dashboard par tap karein. Filter chunein (Today, Week, Month, All Time). Net Profit = Net Revenue (Sales minus Returns) minus COGS (Purchase Costs) minus Operational Expenses.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_10_title">10. App Security PIN aur Theme kaise set karein?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_10_desc">Settings -&gt; Language aur Preferences mein jayein aur System, Light ya Dark Theme chunein. Security -&gt; App PIN Lock mein jayein aur cold start protection ke liye 4-digit PIN set karein.</string>
