    <string name="help_topic_11_title">11. Store Currency kaise change karein?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_11_desc">Settings -&gt; Store Currency par jayein. Apni local currency (USD $, AED, EUR €, GBP £, PKR, INR ₹, SAR, CAD, AUD) chunein ya custom symbol enter karein. Aapke store receipts, inventory aur financial reports foran chosen currency mein format ho jayenge.</string>
